---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Boise Tree Pros"
  description="Terms of service for Boise Tree Pros. Terms and conditions for using our website and services."
  canonical="https://boisetreepro.com/terms/"
  ogTitle="Terms of Service | Boise Tree Pros"
  ogDescription="Terms of service for Boise Tree Pros. Terms and conditions for using our website and services."
  ogImage="https://boisetreepro.com/images/og-image.png"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
<style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; color: #363636; background: #FAF0E6; }
    h1,h2,h3,h4 { font-family: 'Zilla Slab', Georgia, serif; }

    .nav-link {
      color: #FAF0E6;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.18s, color 0.18s;
    }
    .nav-link:hover { background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
    .nav-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 2px; }
    .nav-link:active { opacity: 0.7; }

    .dropdown-link { display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 10px 18px; min-height: 48px; font-size: 14px; color: #363636; text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, opacity 0.2s; outline: none; }
    .dropdown-link:hover { background-color: #f0e8de; color: #1A531A; }
    .dropdown-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #1A531A; outline-offset: -2px; }
    .dropdown-link:active { background-color: #e0d4c4; }

    .footer-link {
      color: #d4c5b0;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      transition: color 0.18s;
    }
    .footer-link:hover { color: #FAF0E6; }
    .footer-link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 2px; }
    .footer-link:active { opacity: 0.7; }

    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #1A531A;
      color: #FAF0E6;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 0.18s, transform 0.15s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(26,83,26,0.35), 0 1px 3px rgba(26,83,26,0.2);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background-color: #16451a; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(26,83,26,0.4), 0 2px 6px rgba(26,83,26,0.25); }
    .btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #87CEEB; outline-offset: 3px; }
    .btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(0); opacity: 0.88; }

    .prose h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1A531A; margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .prose h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: #363636; margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem; }
    .prose p { line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ul { list-style: disc; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ul li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .prose ol { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .prose ol li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.7; }
    .prose strong { color: #1a1a1a; font-weight: 600; }
    .prose a { color: #1A531A; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .prose a:hover { color: #8B5A2B; }

    /* mobile menu */
    #mobile-menu { display: none; }
    #mobile-menu.open { display: block; }
  </style>
<script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://boisetreepro.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Terms of Service", "item": "https://boisetreepro.com/terms/" }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-4">
  <ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:8px;font-size:13px;color:#888;">
    <li><a href="/" style="color:#8B5A2B;text-decoration:none;">Home</a></li>
    <li>/</li>
    <li style="color:#363636;">Terms of Service</li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0F3010 0%, #1A531A 40%, #2A6B2A 100%);padding:64px 0 72px;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div style="max-width:720px;">
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,44px);font-weight:700;color:#FAF0E6;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:16px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:rgba(250,240,230,0.85);max-width:620px;">The terms you accept by using this site, and the line between what we do and what the contractor who takes your job does.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding:64px 0 80px;">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="prose" style="max-width:760px;">

      <p>These terms govern your use of boisetreepro.com. By using the site or calling a number published on it, you accept them. If you do not accept them, please do not use the site.</p>

      <h2>What this site is</h2>
      <p>boisetreepro.com publishes information about tree care in Boise and the Treasure Valley, and is how you reach Boise Tree Pros for tree removal, trimming, stump grinding, and emergency storm work.</p>

      <h2>Quotes, estimates and prices</h2>
      <p>Price ranges published on this site are general ballparks for the Boise area, offered to help you budget and to help you recognise a quote that is unusually high or suspiciously low. A range is never a quote, an offer, or a commitment. Only an on-site inspection can price your job, and the scope, price, schedule and cleanup are agreed in writing before work begins.</p>
      <p>Before any tree work starts, you are entitled to see proof of liability insurance and workers' compensation coverage. Our guide to <a href="/blog/how-to-hire-tree-service-boise/">hiring a tree service</a> explains what to ask for and how to verify it.</p>

      <h2>Information, not advice</h2>
      <p>Content on this site is general information. It is not arboricultural, engineering, legal, insurance, or financial advice, and it is not a substitute for a qualified arborist inspecting your specific tree or for confirming a requirement with your city.</p>
      <p>Prices published here are general ranges for the Boise area, offered so you can budget and recognise an outlier. They are not quotes, offers, or commitments, and the contractor who inspects your property sets the actual price.</p>
      <p>Building codes, permit requirements, and enforcement differ between Boise, Meridian, Nampa, Caldwell, Eagle, and Garden City, and they change. Confirm anything consequential with the relevant city before acting.</p>

      <h2>Emergencies</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this site is an emergency service. If a tree has fallen on a structure, a vehicle, or a person, or if anything is touching a power line, call 911 and your utility. Never approach a downed line.</p>

      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Do not submit false information or another person's details through the contact form.</li>
        <li>Do not use the site to harass, or to send automated or bulk enquiries.</li>
        <li>Do not scrape, copy, or republish site content without permission.</li>
        <li>Do not attempt to interfere with the site's operation or security.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The text, layout, and design of this site are ours and are protected by copyright. You may read, print, and share pages for your own use. Republishing content, in whole or substantial part, requires our written permission.</p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>We link to outside resources &mdash; city departments, utilities, professional bodies &mdash; because they are useful. We do not control them and are not responsible for their content or their practices.</p>

      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>The site is provided &quot;as is&quot;. We work to keep it accurate and current, but we do not warrant that it is free of errors or omissions, that it will be available uninterrupted, or that any particular contractor will be available to you.</p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the fullest extent permitted by Idaho law, Boise Tree Pros is not liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of this site, from information published on it, or from work performed by a contractor you were connected with. Claims relating to the work itself lie against the contractor who performed it.</p>
      <p>Nothing here limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>

      <h2>Privacy</h2>
      <p>How we handle your information, including the fact that calls are tracked and may be recorded, is set out in our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may revise these terms. The version published here at the time you use the site is the one that applies.</p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Idaho.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: <a href="/#contact">get in touch</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:2.5rem;font-size:14px;color:#888;">Last updated: 19 August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
